  "source": "Works in Progress",
  "title": "Now in store at Barnes & Noble and Hudson News stores across America",
  "subtitle": "Get a free Works in Progress tote bag for showing us your copy outside a store.",
  "byline": "Works in Progress",
  "publishedAt": "2026-11-04T16:18:39.000Z",
  "contentHtml": "<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3WQD!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4a27e60a-860e-4cd9-ab0e-2d32c4d200f9_3024x4032.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3WQD!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4a27e60a-860e-4cd9-ab0e-2d32c4d200f9_3024x4032.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1941\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure>\n<p>From today, Works in Progress is now in stock at Barnes &amp; Nobles nationwide across America. </p>\n<p>We’re in 570 stores in 49 states*, including the flagship stores at Union Square &amp; Fifth Avenue in NYC; Georgetown, DC; State Street, Chicago; The Grove, Los Angeles; and the Barnes &amp; Noble branches at San Francisco Airport.</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-y1t!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0f0e8db1-bdf9-4795-8bce-482b41e905cf_3024x2243.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-y1t!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0f0e8db1-bdf9-4795-8bce-482b41e905cf_3024x2243.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1080\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure>\n<p><span>We’re also now in Hudson News outlets across most major US airports, and a handful of independent newsagents in New York, Paris, Berlin, Los Angeles, and London including </span><a href=\"https://magculture.com/?srsltid=AYCX9vLyXAOJBW1MMBq9143mdJnfwKvqBaPQiIe4dWYHPHh_jZSZid4T\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">magCulture</a><span> in Clerkenwell (from tomorrow) and </span><a href=\"https://www.shreejinewsagents.com/?srsltid=AYCX9vLgsfzIKmRAgplROZ6DPh7SXNGjZIzJI11eTXu9sNhnL6PgUeHj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Shreeji News on Chiltern St</a><span>. </span></p>\n<p>If you Substack Note, Tweet, LinkedIn, or Instagram a photo of your copy of Works in Progress outside any of these stores, share the post with us and we’ll send you a free tote bag as a thank you. If you’re a subscriber already, feel free to do it with your own copy!</p>\n<p><span>You can see a full map of </span><a href=\"https://worksinprogress.co/barnes-noble-launch/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Barnes &amp; Noble stockists here</a><span>, and enter your Zip code to find your nearest store.</span></p>\n<p>*Sorry, Wyoming, we’ll get to you!</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GTMk!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F95cdfd83-73a7-479c-8081-bfdf919dc784_2200x1592.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GTMk!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F95cdfd83-73a7-479c-8081-bfdf919dc784_2200x1592.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1054\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure>",
